2055	        // time if declared there. Instead, the stale-referencing GroupTable is
2056	        // injected directly onto the loaded workspace's config below, isolating
2057	        // the scenario this bug is actually about: a group config (by whatever
2058	        // means it reached this state) naming a package absent from
